    "body": [
      {
        "primary": {
          "id": null,
          "caption": "We always knew we wanted to create an office experience that would really inspire the team, so to make that happen, we focused on building out a space plan that offered three different transitions throughout the space: communication, collaboration and thinking. I have to say, it’s pretty amazing to see how this new office has really come together and has supported productivity and collaboration and even more so to see how our team is truly thriving from it.",
