            "link_type": "Media",
            "name": "avulsos_00_welbeing.mp3",
            "kind": "document",
            "url": "https://unleashing.cdn.prismic.io/unleashing/435939ad-4f70-4607-8a31-93870416e651_avulsos_00_welbeing.mp3",
            "size": "483942"
          },
          "duration": "00:23",
          "quote": "“Start identifying which pillars you have less satisfactory results or are not happy with, and start creating tasks that will help you get better results..”",
          "playable": true
