            "start": "0.2",
            "duration": "3.9"
          },
          {
            "phrase": "of how we can identify",
            "start": "4",
            "duration": "2"
          },
          {
            "phrase": "align and treat the main pillars of your life",
            "start": "6",
            "duration": "3"
          },
          {
            "phrase": "to avoid engaging in unnecessary problems.",
            "start": "9",
            "duration": "3"
          },
          {
            "phrase": "So you can be more focused on improving your performance",
            "start": "12.5",
            "duration": "3"
          },
          {
            "phrase": "and achieving better results",
            "start": "16",
            "duration": "1.3"
          },
          {
            "phrase": "without sacrificing any essential areas of your life",
            "start": "17.7",
            "duration": "4.3"
          },
          {
            "phrase": "because we truly deserve to achieve more than only an excellent career.",
            "start": "21.75",
            "duration": "4.3"
