            "url": "https://unleashing.cdn.prismic.io/unleashing/da237e6f-e17a-4652-8f7d-fde2f8fc1495_avulsos_01_task_results.mp3",
            "size": "431817"
          },
          "duration": null,
          "quote": "“Sometimes the job is well done, but it doesn't take you anywhere. You might be asking how it's possible. Simple, your actions are not aligned with your goals. You need to understand your goals to be able to reach them.”",
          "playable": true
        },
        "items": [
          {
            "phrase": "This chapter is fully dedicated to understanding how important it's to be efficient instead of busy.",
            "start": "0",
            "duration": "6.8"
          },
          {
            "phrase": "With a detailed insight,",
            "start": "7.5",
            "duration": "1.9"
          },
          {
            "phrase": "you will be aware of identifying if the tasks,",
            "start": "10",
            "duration": "3"
          },
          {
            "phrase": "projects, and actions you have been applying in your life",
            "start": "13.5",
            "duration": "3"
          },
          {
            "phrase": "are taking you to the next level.",
            "start": "16.1",
            "duration": "2.3"
          },
          {
            "phrase": "Because certainly, you don't want to invest your time in doing things",
            "start": "18.5",
            "duration": "5"
          },
          {
            "phrase": "that aren't aligned with your dreams and goals.",
            "start": "23.1",
            "duration": "3.5"
          }
        ],
        "slice_type": "transcript",
        "slice_label": null
      },
      {
        "primary": {
